    "organism_type": "unknown",
    "organism_type_basis": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan places it on the strength path as a support Gu in the set whose core is All-out Effort Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          286
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "path_strength",
          "sys_support_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It is the perfect companion for strength path Gu Masters.",
        "chapters": [
          318
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is like a beetle. It has a small body and a large body, oval and palm-sized. Its body is yellow brown, with an uneven surface, as lumps grow on its back.",
        "chapters": [
          311
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The auction copy is rank four. Strength path Gu have low primeval essence demands, so a rank three Gu Master can barely activate one. Its market price sits around three hundred and eighty thousand primeval stones.",
        "chapters": [
          307
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Bai Ning Bing’s view it looks like a beetle: oval, palm-sized, yellow brown, with an uneven surface and lumps on its back.",
        "chapters": [
          311
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a treasure for strength path Gu Masters.",
        "chapters": [
          306
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The more injuries the Gu Master suffers, and the greater the pain, the more strength they can bring out. That boost still has a ceiling set by the Gu Master’s own foundation.",
        "chapters": [
          318
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "With All-out Effort Gu alone, Fang Yuan can open only one beast phantom outlet at a time. Under injury plus Bitter Strength Gu, more outlets open, so the same All-out Effort Gu can summon several phantoms at once.",
        "chapters": [
          318
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu cannot raise strength without limit; Fang Yuan’s release still caps at the beast phantoms his body already holds.",
        "chapters": [
          319
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Together with All-out Effort Gu and self-reliance Gu it forms a tight strength path combination: injuries raise output while healing keeps that injured state usable in a fight.",
        "chapters": [
          318
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After the battle stage win over Ju Kai Bei, onlookers state the same set again: Bitter Strength Gu lets him grow stronger as the fight continues, and with self-reliance Gu the pairing is treated as near perfect.",
        "chapters": [
          321
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ju_kai_bei"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He first shows the Gu in public while fighting Ju Kai Bei on the battle stage: as wounds pile up, he moves from one beast phantom to three.",
        "chapters": [
          318
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He then moves up to five.",
        "chapters": [
          319
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later, against Century Boy, he again drops defense on purpose so Bitter Strength Gu can raise his output as injuries mount.",
        "chapters": [
          368
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_century_boy"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On San Cha Mountain he presses Tyrant Heng Mei while the Gu raises fighting strength with each wound, and six beast phantoms at once force Tyrant Heng Mei toward retreat.",
        "chapters": [
          340
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_tyrant_heng_mei"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Xue San Si he stacks Bitter Strength Gu with All-out Effort Gu and brings out eight phantoms in one burst.",
        "chapters": [
          343
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_xue_san_si"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "By then he lists Bitter Strength Gu among his six rank four Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          345
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Tie clan Gu Masters wound him, the same Gu turns those injuries into more phantoms and stronger charges; Tie Ba Xiu has to step in to block him.",
        "chapters": [
          360
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_tie_clan",
          "char_tie_ba_xiu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
